      ],
      "impact": "The 12 V rail lacks the intended transient/overvoltage clamping; the board is less protected against inductive kickback from the heater/fan loads than the design intent.",
      "confidence": 0.5
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The schematic largely matches the specification, but the 12 V input protection diode D7 is drawn as a generic diode rather than the TVS device the design intent calls for, so the intended transient clamping on the 12 V rail is not present."
}

